	{ 207, "22003, [cmplx], Bus.Voc, This parameter returns a pointer to an array of complex containing the open circuit voltage for the active bus. Each element is a complex structure including real and imaginary parts (double, 16 Bytes per element). A fault study should be executed first." },
	{ 208, "22004, [cmplx], Bus.Isc, This parameter returns a pointer to an array of complex containing the short circuit current for the active bus. Each element is a complex structure including real and imaginary parts (double, 16 Bytes per element). A fault study should be executed first." },
