	{ 876, "107004, [str], Relays.NormalState - write, This property sets the normal state per phase through an array of strings. Each string must specify the state with a string \"Closed\" or \"Open\". The argument Pointer must be provided by the caller pointing to an array of Bytes containing the array of strings with the state per phase. Each string must be separated within the array by a NULL (0) character. As a result, this command will return the number of Bytes read and successfully written in the argument \"Size\"." },
