	{ 916, "112008, int, Settings.SolverOptions - read, Returns the active Solver Option enabled. The solver options allow the solver engine to refresh the Y bus matrix incrementally instead of rebuilding it all. This parameter applies only to the C++ version. Otherwise, Delphi will return always 0." },
	{ 917, "112009, int, Settings.SolverOptions - write, Sets the active Solver Option. The solver options allow the solver engine to refresh the Y bus matrix incrementally instead of rebuilding it all. This parameter applies only to the C++ version. Otherwise, in Delphi it will have no effect." },
	{ 918, "112010, int, Settings.ControlTrace - read, This property gets {True=1 | False=0} to denote whether to trace the control actions to a file." },
