	{ 1298, "151001, int, UseAuxCurrents - write, The interface will set the value of the variable UseAuxCurrents using the numeric value provided in the argument (1=True, 0=False)." },
	{ 1299, "152000, int, AddInAuxCurrents, This interface executes the procedure AddInAuxCurrents, used in the DoNormalSolution routine to rebuild the Y Matrix. The value of SType (NEWTONSOLVE=1, NORMALSOLVE=0) has the same effect as the underlying OpenDSS function." },
	{ 1300, "153000, int, BuildYMatrixD, This interface executes the procedure BuildYMatrix, used in the DoNormalSolution routine to rebuild the Y Matrix. The values of BuildOps (SERIESONLY=1, WHOLEMATRIX=2) and AllocateVI (TRUE=1, FALSE=0) have the same effect as the underlying OpenDSS function." },
	{ 1301, "154000, int, GetPCInjCurr, This interface commands OpenDSS to include the currents injected by the power conversion devices into the currents vector, following the solution algorithm (DoNormalSolution routine). Takes no argument." },
	{ 1302, "155000, int, GetSourceInjCurrents, This interface commands OpenDSS to include the currents injected by voltage/current sources into the currents vector, following the solution algorithm (DoNormalSolution routine). Takes no argument." },
	{ 1303, "156000, int, ZeroInjCurr, This interface commands OpenDSS to initialize the currents vector as an array of zeros, the first step of the solution algorithm (DoNormalSolution routine). Takes no argument." },
	{ 1304, "157000, str, DSSDisposeString, Disposes of the memory used by a string previously returned by this API. Must be called for any string returned by the *I/*F/*S functions or by OpenDSS(), except for string arrays returned by the *V() functions, which use a shared global buffer." },
